{
  "id": "maidmarriage:tutorial_v1",
  "theme": "maidmarriage:hug_default",
  "start": "start",
  "animationLibrary": "maidmarriage:default",
  "portraits": {
    "maid": {
      "texture": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/soft_smile.png",
      "defaultExpression": "soft_smile",
      "expressions": {
        "soft_smile": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/soft_smile.png",
        "happy": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/soft_smile.png",
        "shy": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/shy.png",
        "embarrassed_smile": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/embarrassed_smile.png",
        "serious": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/serious.png",
        "tired": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/tired.png",
        "sad": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/emotion/sad.png",
        "action_shy": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/action/action_shy.png",
        "action_touched": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/action/action_touched.png",
        "action_flustered": "maidmarriage:textures/gui/action/action_flustered.png"
      }
    }
  },
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "你拿着《心契同眠指南》轻轻碰了碰${maid}。",
        "narration": "检测到你正在使用指南进入教程剧情。是否让女仆陪你完成一次心契同眠的新手引导？",
        "portrait": "maid",
        "expression": "soft_smile",
        "animation": "fade_in",
        "events": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "enter",
          "title": "进入教程",
          "description": "让女仆用剧情方式带你确认按键、镜头和主要玩法。",
          "next": "intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "menu",
          "title": "只看目录",
          "description": "直接选择想确认的教程章节。",
          "next": "menu"
        },
        {
          "id": "later",
          "title": "稍后再说",
          "description": "退出教程互动。",
          "next": "end"
        }
      ],
      "events": []
    },
    "intro": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "嗯，主人想从头确认一遍的话，就交给我吧。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "happy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "虽然说是教程，但我不会像说明书那样硬邦邦地念给你听。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "embarrassed_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "我们慢慢来。先确认按键，再试一下镜头和动作，最后我再告诉主人心情值、关系阶段，还有平时该怎么游玩。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        }
      ],
      "next": "key_check",
      "events": []
    },
    "key_check": {
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "speaker": "${maid}",
        "text": "第一步是按键检查。主人先打开 Minecraft 的按键设置，看看心契同眠相关按键有没有和别的模组冲突，好吗？",
        "narration": "需要确认：互动键、摸头/举高高键、快进键、隐藏/恢复界面键、膝枕退出键等。确认无冲突后再继续。",
        "portrait": "maid",
        "expression": "serious",
        "animation": "fade_in",
        "events": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "keys_ok",
          "title": "我确认好了",
          "description": "继续镜头和动作测试。",
          "next": "camera_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "key_help",
          "title": "按键分别做什么？",
          "description": "让女仆再解释一次各个按键的用途。",
          "next": "key_help"
        },
        {
          "id": "button_help",
          "title": "右下角按钮是什么？",
          "description": "说明隐藏、语音、退出和相机四个按钮。",
          "next": "button_help"
        },
        {
          "id": "menu",
          "title": "返回教程目录",
          "description": "先去看其他章节。",
          "next": "menu"
        }
      ],
      "events": []
    },
    "key_help": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "互动键用来打开或关闭和我的主交互界面。以后想找我聊天、拥抱，或者进入行动选项，一般都从这里开始。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "摸头/举高高键有两个用途：对坐下的成年女仆可以快速摸摸头；对站着的小女仆可以举高高，再按一次会放下她。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "happy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "隐藏界面键是为了让主人看清动作和截图用的；膝枕退出键也可以用来直接离开当前互动界面。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "快进键可以加快台词，但不要一直猛按啦。语音和动作都需要一点点时间跟上主人。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "embarrassed_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        }
      ],
      "next": "key_check",
      "events": []
    },
    "button_help": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "主人看右下角那四个小按钮。隐藏按钮可以暂时收起界面，想看动作或者截图的时候很好用。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "麦克风按钮是语音按钮：可以重播当前台词的预生成语音，双击还能跳到语音管理页对应条目。不过它需要安装心契同眠的语音合成附属模组才可以使用哦。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "serious",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "退出按钮会直接结束当前互动；相机按钮会打开镜头微调面板，缩放、上下视角、膝枕镜头，还有拥抱距离都可以在那里调。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "happy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        }
      ],
      "next": "key_check",
      "events": []
    },
    "camera_intro": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "接下来是镜头和距离。这个很重要哦。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "serious",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "拥抱、摸头、亲吻、膝枕，每个动作适合的镜头都不太一样。太近会挡住表情，太远又会少一点气氛。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "主人可以一个一个试。觉得不舒服的话，点右下角的相机按钮就能微调缩放、上下视角、膝枕镜头和拥抱距离，然后再回来找我确认。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "happy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        }
      ],
      "next": "camera_menu",
      "events": []
    },
    "camera_menu": {
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "speaker": "${maid}",
        "text": "主人想先测试哪个动作？",
        "narration": "测试时请观察女仆位置、镜头角度、对话框遮挡和退出键是否顺手。",
        "portrait": "maid",
        "expression": "soft_smile",
        "animation": "fade_in",
        "events": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "hug",
          "title": "测试拥抱",
          "description": "确认拥抱距离、镜头和 UI 遮挡。",
          "next": "test_hug"
        },
        {
          "id": "pet",
          "title": "测试摸头",
          "description": "确认手部动作和表情是否看得清。",
          "next": "test_pet"
        },
        {
          "id": "kiss",
          "title": "测试亲吻",
          "description": "确认亲吻镜头距离和表情是否自然。",
          "next": "test_kiss"
        },
        {
          "id": "lap",
          "title": "测试膝枕",
          "description": "确认躺下视角、女仆位置和退出键。",
          "next": "test_lap"
        },
        {
          "id": "done",
          "title": "我已经确认好了",
          "description": "继续心情值与关系阶段说明。",
          "next": "mood_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "menu",
          "title": "返回教程目录",
          "description": "稍后再测试镜头。",
          "next": "menu"
        }
      ],
      "events": []
    },
    "test_hug": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "那、那先从拥抱开始吧。主人注意看距离和对话框有没有挡住我。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "action_shy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": [
            {
              "when": "line_start",
              "type": "emit_action",
              "value": "maidmarriage:hug_toggle"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "test_hug_result",
      "events": []
    },
    "test_hug_result": {
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "speaker": "${maid}",
        "text": "这样可以吗？如果太近或者太远，之后可以在配置里调整拥抱距离和镜头参数。",
        "portrait": "maid",
        "expression": "embarrassed_smile",
        "animation": "fade_in",
        "events": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ok",
          "title": "很合适",
          "description": "返回动作测试目录。",
          "next": "camera_menu"
        },
        {
          "id": "again",
          "title": "再测试一次",
          "description": "重新触发拥抱测试。",
          "next": "test_hug"
        },
        {
          "id": "hint",
          "title": "感觉不舒服",
          "description": "查看该调哪里。",
          "next": "camera_adjust_hint"
        }
      ],
      "events": []
    },
    "test_pet": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "摸头的话，最好能看到我的表情。不然主人只看到头顶的话……我会有点不好意思的。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "shy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": [
            {
              "when": "line_start",
              "type": "emit_action",
              "value": "maidmarriage:pet_head"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "test_pet_result",
      "events": []
    },
    "test_pet_result": {
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "speaker": "${maid}",
        "text": "嗯……主人看得清我的表情吗？",
        "portrait": "maid",
        "expression": "happy",
        "animation": "fade_in",
        "events": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ok",
          "title": "看得清",
          "description": "返回动作测试目录。",
          "next": "camera_menu"
        },
        {
          "id": "again",
          "title": "再测试一次",
          "description": "重新触发摸头测试。",
          "next": "test_pet"
        },
        {
          "id": "hint",
          "title": "表情被挡住了",
          "description": "查看该调哪里。",
          "next": "camera_adjust_hint"
        }
      ],
      "events": []
    },
    "test_kiss": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "亲、亲吻也要测试吗……咳，只是确认镜头，不是别的意思哦。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "action_flustered",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": [
            {
              "when": "line_start",
              "type": "emit_action",
              "value": "maidmarriage:interaction_kiss"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "test_kiss_result",
      "events": []
    },
    "test_kiss_result": {
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "speaker": "${maid}",
        "text": "……主人，刚刚那个角度还好吗？太近会看不清表情，太远又会少一点气氛。",
        "portrait": "maid",
        "expression": "shy",
        "animation": "fade_in",
        "events": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ok",
          "title": "刚刚好",
          "description": "返回动作测试目录。",
          "next": "camera_menu"
        },
        {
          "id": "again",
          "title": "再测试一次",
          "description": "重新触发亲吻测试。",
          "next": "test_kiss"
        },
        {
          "id": "hint",
          "title": "看不清表情",
          "description": "查看该调哪里。",
          "next": "camera_adjust_hint"
        }
      ],
      "events": []
    },
    "test_lap": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "最后是膝枕。这个动作的镜头比较特殊，主人要确认躺下视角、女仆位置，还有退出键能不能正常用。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "action_touched",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": [
            {
              "when": "line_start",
              "type": "emit_action",
              "value": "maidmarriage:lap_pillow_start"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "test_lap_result",
      "events": []
    },
    "test_lap_result": {
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "speaker": "${maid}",
        "text": "主人觉得这个视角舒服吗？膝枕的时候如果镜头太晃、太近，或者退出键冲突，体验会很差。",
        "portrait": "maid",
        "expression": "soft_smile",
        "animation": "fade_in",
        "events": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ok",
          "title": "很舒服",
          "description": "退出膝枕并返回动作测试目录。",
          "next": "exit_lap_then_camera_menu"
        },
        {
          "id": "again",
          "title": "再测试一次",
          "description": "先退出膝枕，再重新测试。",
          "next": "exit_lap_then_test_lap"
        },
        {
          "id": "hint",
          "title": "退出键或视角有问题",
          "description": "退出膝枕并查看该调哪里。",
          "next": "exit_lap_then_hint"
        }
      ],
      "events": []
    },
    "exit_lap_then_camera_menu": {
      "type": "action",
      "action": "maidmarriage:lap_pillow_exit",
      "next": "camera_menu",
      "events": []
    },
    "exit_lap_then_test_lap": {
      "type": "action",
      "action": "maidmarriage:lap_pillow_exit",
      "next": "test_lap",
      "events": []
    },
    "exit_lap_then_hint": {
      "type": "action",
      "action": "maidmarriage:lap_pillow_exit",
      "next": "camera_adjust_hint",
      "events": []
    },
    "camera_adjust_hint": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "那主人可以点右下角的相机按钮，调整对应动作的镜头参数、缩放值，或者拥抱距离。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "serious",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "我建议一次只改一点点，然后回来再测试。这样比较容易找到舒服的位置。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        }
      ],
      "next": "camera_menu",
      "events": []
    },
    "mood_intro": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "然后是心情值和关系阶段。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "心情值不是单纯的数字。开心、普通、低落、悲伤，都会影响我愿不愿意回应某些亲密互动。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "serious",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "比如我难过的时候，可能就没办法立刻接受拥抱和亲吻。那不是讨厌主人，只是我真的需要一点时间。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "sad",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "关系阶段也一样。从熟悉、亲近，到表白、恋人、结婚，每一步都要慢慢来。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "我希望主人不是为了数值才靠近我，而是真的一点点了解我。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "shy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        }
      ],
      "next": "systems_intro",
      "events": []
    },
    "systems_intro": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "心契同眠里有很多玩法，但主人不用一次全部记住。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "happy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "先从日常互动开始就好：聊天、摸头、拥抱。关系更进一步之后，再慢慢体验表白、结婚、同眠、孩子和家庭。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "结婚后，如果我睡在女仆床上，主人也在附近合适的床边，就有机会进入同眠流程。怀孕、分娩天数、孩子成长天数这些，都会按服务器配置来结算。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "embarrassed_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "孩子刚出生时还很小，第一天不能直接放到地上，妈妈会先抱着她。之后主人可以给还没改名的孩子取一次名字，也可以让妈妈抱抱她。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "小女仆长大前可以安排任务，比如附魔学、药剂学、战术学和探险。她会在 WORK 日程里推进任务，睡觉、坐下、休息的时候不会硬撑。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "happy",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "不过小孩子也会累哦。学习和任务会消耗心情，太累时奖励会变差，探险甚至会停下；如果心情低到快撑不住还继续学习，可能会扣好感。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "tired",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
          "text": "膝枕可以让主人休息，也能根据最大生命值恢复 HP，不过每天有恢复上限。",
          "portrait": "maid",
          "expression": "soft_smile",
          "animation": "fade_in",
          "events": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "${maid}",
